    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company Faber IA can propose an architecture based on our existing Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our existing Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure, ensuring compliance with the client's hosting requirements and avoiding dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
